-- ? ON OPTION IN A RESULT FUNCTION ----------------------------- main.kl  K1302

This `?` is applied to an `Option`, but the function returns a `Result`. A missing value has no error to pass up, so you need to say which error it is.

2│     let n = xs.get(0)?
               ^^^^^^^^^^

Help: Turn the missing value into an error first: `.ok_or(error)?`.

Learn more: kalam explain K1302
